│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ enhanced_entanglement_with_sharing                                                        │
│ patch_description        │ Improve expressivity by:                                                                  │
│                          │ 1. Replacing the linear CZ chain with a more connected pattern (CZ on alternating pairs)  │
│                          │ 2. Adding parametrized CRY gates for controlled rotations that create stronger            │
│                          │ entanglement                                                                              │
│                          │ 3. Using parameter sharing within each block to reduce total parameters while maintaining │
│                          │ expressivity                                                                              │
│                          │ 4. Removing redundant independent RZ gates and consolidating to a single RZ layer         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
