│ patch_type               │ diff                                                                                      │
│ patch_name               │ adaptive_block_structure                                                                  │
│ patch_description        │ Instead of adding global lambda scalars (which require changes outside EVOLVE-BLOCK), we  │
│                          │ can achieve adaptive weighting by introducing parametrized scaling gates within the       │
│                          │ ansatz itself. We add RZ rotations at strategic points that act as learnable amplitude    │
│                          │ modulators for each upload cycle.                                                         │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ **Rationale:**                                                                            │
│                          │ 1. The current program achieves 0.93 test accuracy with 26 params and convergence at 270  │
│                          │ steps.                                                                                    │
│                          │ 2. By adding parametrized single-qubit gates that serve as adaptive scalars, we can       │
│                          │ improve convergence speed and test accuracy without modifying the fixed training loop.    │
│                          │ 3. We introduce three "scaling layers" (one per conceptual upload cycle, applied after    │
│                          │ the main entanglement structure) using shared RX parameters that modulate the effective   │
│                          │ amplitude of the block.                                                                   │
│                          │ 4. This is parameter-efficient and stays within EVOLVE-BLOCK constraints.                 │
│                          │                                                                                           │
│                          │ **Implementation:**                                                                       │
│                          │ - Add three new parametrized layers with RX gates (one shared parameter per layer) that   │
│                          │ act as adaptive amplitude modulators.                                                     │
│                          │ - These layers are placed strategically to weight the contribution of each upload cycle.  │
│                          │ - Initialize with small angles so the circuit behavior remains close to the current good  │
│                          │ solution.                                                                                 │
│ num_applied              │ 1                                                                                         │
